---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import { gallerySrcset, heroSrcset } from '../../../utils/images';
---

<Layout
  locale="fr"
  title="Les Restaurants | Toile Blanche | Saint-Paul de Vence"
  description="Deux tables qui valent le détour. Construites autour de ce qui est de saison, local et honnête."
  ogImage="https://www.toileblanche.com/assets/images/restaurant/IMG_7598.jpg"
  hideBookingBar={true}
  loadZenchef={true}
>
  <Nav theme="both" locale="fr" ctaText="Réserver une table" ctaAction="zenchef" />

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="rst-hero">
      <div class="rst-hero-image">
        <img src="/assets/images/restaurant/IMG_7598.jpg" srcset={heroSrcset('/assets/images/restaurant/IMG_7598.jpg')} sizes="100vw" width="4032" height="3024" alt="Dîner à Toile Blanche" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        <div class="rst-hero-overlay"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rst-hero-content">
        <p class="rst-hero-eyebrow">La Cuisine</p>
        <h1>Deux tables qui valent<br />le détour</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rst-tagline">
      <div class="rst-tagline-inner">
        <p>Construites autour de ce qui est de saison, local et honnête. Le jardin d'herbes aromatiques est à vingt mètres de la cuisine.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rst-venues">
      <div class="rst-venues-inner">
        <div class="rst-venue">
          <a href="/fr/le-restaurant" class="rst-venue-image">
            <img src="/assets/images/page-img-14433f29c9500d.jpg" alt="Le Restaurant de Toile Blanche" width="1170" height="780" loading="lazy" />
          </a>
          <div class="rst-venue-content">
            <h2 id="rst-title-restaurant"><a href="/fr/le-restaurant" class="rst-venue-title-link">Le Restaurant</a></h2>
            <p class="rst-venue-tagline">Plus réfléchi, plus intime, une cuisine à son meilleur.</p>
            <p class="rst-venue-desc">Une ode à la Côte d'Azur, où la tradition méditerranéenne se réinvente à travers un prisme contemporain. Ouvert toute l'année pour le dîner.</p>
            <div class="rst-venue-actions">
              <a href="/fr/le-restaurant" class="rst-venue-link">Découvrir Le Restaurant &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rst-venue">
          <a href="/fr/la-guinguette" class="rst-venue-image">
            <img src="/assets/images/page-img-7f72d09199a7a2.jpg" alt="La Guinguette de Toile Blanche" width="1170" height="1702" loading="lazy" />
          </a>
          <div class="rst-venue-content">
            <h2 id="rst-title-guinguette"><a href="/fr/la-guinguette" class="rst-venue-title-link">La Guinguette</a></h2>
            <p class="rst-venue-tagline">Le déjeuner sous les platanes — rosé, poisson grillé, le plaisir spécifique de manger dehors en Provence.</p>
            <p class="rst-venue-desc">Ouverte de mai à octobre, La Guinguette est le cœur du jardin. Venez pieds nus ou en espadrilles. Le Sud balayera vos soucis — si vous en aviez.</p>
            <div class="rst-venue-actions">
              <a href="/fr/la-guinguette" class="rst-venue-link">Découvrir La Guinguette &rarr;</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PETIT-DÉJEUNER -->
    <section class="rst-breakfast">
      <div class="rst-breakfast-inner">
        <a href="/fr/breakfast" class="rst-breakfast-image rst-breakfast-image-fixed">
          <img src="/assets/images/breakfast/4f3bf84f-fd91-4f40-84eb-dc95844afcda.jpg" srcset={gallerySrcset('/assets/images/breakfast/4f3bf84f-fd91-4f40-84eb-dc95844afcda.jpg')} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1170" height="1422" alt="Le Petit-Déjeuner à Toile Blanche" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
        <div class="rst-breakfast-content">
          <p class="rst-breakfast-eyebrow">Chaque Matin</p>
          <h2 id="rst-title-breakfast"><a href="/fr/breakfast" class="rst-venue-title-link">Le Petit-Déjeuner</a></h2>
          <p class="rst-breakfast-tagline">Le café, les croissants, et le bruit du jardin qui se réveille. L'un des souvenirs les plus chers de nos hôtes.</p>
          <p class="rst-breakfast-desc">Pain frais d'un boulanger local. Fruits de saison. Œufs préparés à votre goût. Miel local, confitures et fromages. Jus d'orange pressé le matin même. Servi dans la salle du petit-déjeuner, en terrasse ou livré dans votre suite.</p>
          <p class="rst-breakfast-hours">Servi tous les jours, 8h00 – 10h30</p>
          <a href="/fr/breakfast" class="rst-venue-link">En savoir plus &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rst-philosophy">
      <div class="rst-philosophy-inner">
        <h2>La carte des vins est une déclaration d'amour à la région. Les tomates sont arrivées ce matin.</h2>
        <p>Les deux menus suivent le rythme des saisons, construits autour de partenariats avec des producteurs locaux. À Toile Blanche, le dialogue avec le paysage commence par l'art. Il se poursuit à table.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rst-cta">
      <p>La table est mise.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer locale="fr" />
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .rst-hero { position: relative; height: 85vh; min-height: 500px; overflow: hidden; }
  .rst-hero-image { position: absolute; inset: 0; }
  .rst-hero-image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .rst-hero-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 0%, transparent 55%); }
  .rst-hero-content { position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; padding: 0 80px 72px; color: #fff; }
  .rst-hero-eyebrow { font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #fff; }
  .rst-hero-content h1 { font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif; font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 72px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; color: #fff; }
  .rst-tagline { border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC; }
  .rst-tagline-inner { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 80px; text-align: center; }
  .rst-tagline-inner p { font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px); line-height: 1.55; color: #3D3530; }
  .rst-venues { border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC; }
  .rst-venues-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: start; }
  .rst-venue-image { display: block; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .rst-venue-content { padding-top: 80px; }
  .rst-venue-image img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/3; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform 0.8s ease; }
  .rst-venue:hover .rst-venue-image img { transform: scale(1.02); }
  .rst-venue-content h2 { font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 52px) !important; font-weight: 400; color: #1C1917; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .rst-venue-title-link { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .rst-venue-title-link:hover { color: #9e5c4a; }
  .rst-venue-tagline { font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; color: #9e5c4a; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .rst-venue-desc { font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #6B6256; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .rst-venue-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .rst-venue-btn { display: inline-block; width: fit-content; font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; color: #FAF8F3; background: #9e5c4a; padding: 16px 36px; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
  .rst-venue-btn:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  .rst-venue-link { font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; color: #9C9080; transition: color 0.2s; }
  .rst-venue-link:hover { color: #3D3530; }
  .rst-breakfast { border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC; }
  .rst-breakfast-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: center; }
  .rst-breakfast-image { display: block; overflow: hidden; }
  .rst-breakfast-image img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16/9; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 35%; display: block; transition: transform 0.8s ease; }
  .rst-breakfast:hover .rst-breakfast-image img { transform: scale(1.02); }
  .rst-breakfast-eyebrow { font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9C9080; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .rst-breakfast-content h2 { font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 52px) !important; font-weight: 400; color: #1C1917; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .rst-breakfast-tagline { font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; color: #9e5c4a; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .rst-breakfast-desc { font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: #6B6256; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .rst-breakfast-hours { font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9C9080; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .rst-philosophy { border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC; }
  .rst-philosophy-inner { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 80px; text-align: center; }
  .rst-philosophy-inner h2 { font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 44px); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; color: #1C1917; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .rst-philosophy-inner p { font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #6B6256; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .rst-cta { padding: 80px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2D9CC; }
  .rst-cta p { font-family: 'Gilda Display', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 28px); color: #3D3530; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .rst-cta-btn { display: inline-block; font-family: 'Didact Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; color: #FAF8F3; background: #9e5c4a; padding: 16px 36px; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
  .rst-cta-btn:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .rst-hero-content { padding: 0 24px 48px; }
    .rst-tagline-inner { padding: 48px 24px; }
    .rst-venues-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 48px 24px; gap: 48px; }
    .rst-breakfast-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 48px 24px; gap: 32px; }
    .rst-philosophy-inner { padding: 64px 24px; }
    .rst-cta { padding: 48px 24px; }
  }
</style>
